      "link": "https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/30/headteacher-saves-children-flash-flood-nepal",
      "description": "<p>Rajendra Dawadi ordered students to higher ground with moments to spare after receiving warnings from upstream</p><p>A headteacher in Nepal evacuated 900 children from a school moments before a deadly wall of water struck their town amid the devastating flash floods that have killed almost 800 people and left thousands missing.</p><p>Rajendra Dawadi decided to halt classes and order children to higher ground after receiving warnings about the scale of the flooding heading their way.</p> <a href=\"https://www.theguardian.com/world/2026/aug/30/headteacher-saves-children-flash-flood-nepal\">Continue reading...</a>",
